---
---
<section class="section-process-timeline" id="process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process-header">
      <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; border-color: rgba(105, 83, 138, 0.2);">
        Step by step
      </span>
      <h2 class="process-title">This is how your company's new presence is born.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline-wrapper">
      <div class="timeline-line"></div>

      <!-- Step 01 -->
      <div class="timeline-step">
        <div class="timeline-node">01</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">We understand the company</h3>
          <p class="step-text">We clarify the situation, the offer, the audience and the desired effect.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 02 -->
      <div class="timeline-step step-right">
        <div class="timeline-node">02</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">We develop the base</h3>
          <p class="step-text">We organize the messages, content, structure, visual direction and requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 03 -->
      <div class="timeline-step">
        <div class="timeline-node">03</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">We determine what the project includes</h3>
          <p class="step-text">We agree on services, information, responsibilities and approvals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 04 -->
      <div class="timeline-step step-right">
        <div class="timeline-node">04</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">We carry out the design and development</h3>
          <p class="step-text">We create the content, design, and implementation in coordinated stages.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 05 -->
      <div class="timeline-step">
        <div class="timeline-node">05</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">We check and deliver</h3>
          <p class="step-text">We check the agreed elements, publish and hand over the documentation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="process-footer">
      <p>
        Gabriel Pop personally leads the project. Our team brings together the necessary skills for content, design and technology, based on the agreed requirements.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-process-timeline {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .process-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  .process-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.2;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .timeline-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }
  
  .timeline-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--border-light);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .timeline-step {
    position: relative;
    width: 50%;
    padding-right: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .timeline-step.step-right {
    margin-left: 50%;
    padding-right: 0;
    padding-left: 3rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .timeline-step:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .timeline-node {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: -24px;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--brand-navy);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    z-index: 2;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px #ffffff;
  }
  .step-right .timeline-node {
    left: -24px;
    right: auto;
  }

  .timeline-content {
    background: var(--bg-page);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .step-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .step-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .process-footer {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 4rem auto 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .timeline-line {
      left: 24px;
      transform: none;
    }
    .timeline-step {
      width: 100%;
      padding-left: 4rem;
      padding-right: 0;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .timeline-step.step-right {
      margin-left: 0;
      padding-left: 4rem;
    }
    .timeline-node, .step-right .timeline-node {
      left: 0;
      right: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
